'' RUN: the cleanup-trace matrix (audit F-04, F-20, F-21, F-22): a goto out of an IF arm,
'' out of a scope into a sibling, backward over a dim, an exit from a WITH over a
'' temporary, and a defer registered again by a backward goto. Each destructor and defer
'' runs exactly as fbc runs it. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/cleanup-trace.bas -o tests/codegen/cleanuptrace.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/cleanuptrace.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: + 6- 6[lbl3]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: + 3- 3[lbl]
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: + 0- 0+ 1- 1+ 2- 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: + 1- 1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: [d2][d3][d4]
